cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CA-ZTCF: Coexistence-Aware Zero Trust Continuity Framework (research prototype)"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype of a service-domain Zero Trust continuity function that re-evaluates
  IoT device trust at 5G/WiFi access transitions using only evidence each access domain can
  realistically expose, without cross-domain identifier sharing. Developed as part of a
  master's thesis in Computer Networks Engineering. No performance or security claims are
  made by this software; its properties are evaluated experimentally in later releases.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Alabdullah"
    given-names: "Mohammed"
keywords:
  - zero trust
  - IoT authentication
  - 5G
  - WiFi
  - trust continuity
  - access transition
